  <!-- EN: mechanoid stasis container -->
  <APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.label>contenedor de estasis mecanoide</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.label>
  <!-- EN: A specialized stasis container designed for the safe storage of mechanoids. Placing a mechanoid inside completely severs its active neural link with the mechanitor and puts its systems into deep suspended animation. In this state, the machine consumes no power and does not occupy the mechanitor's bandwidth, freeing up valuable network resources. The container allows you to keep an assault or worker squad in reserve, ready for deployment at a moment's notice without risking network overload. -->
  <APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.description>Un contenedor de estasis especializado, diseñado para almacenar mecanoides de forma segura. Meter un mecanoide dentro corta por completo su enlace neuronal activo con el mecanizador y sume sus sistemas en una animación suspendida profunda. En ese estado, la máquina no consume energía ni ocupa banda ancha del mecanizador, lo que libera valiosos recursos de red. El contenedor te permite mantener en reserva un escuadrón de asalto o de trabajo, listo para desplegarse en cualquier momento sin arriesgarte a sobrecargar la red.</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.description>
  <!-- EN: Extract mechanoid from stasis container. -->
  <APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activateDescString>Extraer al mecanoide del contenedor de estasis.</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Extract -->
  <APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activateLabelString>Extraer</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: extracting from {0}: {1}s -->
  <APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activatingString>extrayendo de {0}: {1} s</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activatingString>
  <!-- EN: extracting from {0} -->
  <APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activatingStringPending>extrayendo de {0}</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.comps.Comp_MechanoidContainerControlled.activatingStringPending>
  <!-- EN: Instruct mechanoid to enter stasis. -->
